FROM golang:1.27-alpine AS build
WORKDIR /src
# external/ must precede go mod download: go.mod has filesystem
# replace directives (./external/gossip-system, ./external/grpc-service)
# and download fails when the targets are absent.
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
COPY external/ ./external/
RUN go mod download
COPY . .
ARG VERSION=dev
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -ldflags "-s -w -X main.version=$VERSION" -o /beacon-server ./cmd/beacon-server

FROM alpine:3.21
RUN apk add --no-cache wget ca-certificates tini && adduser -D -u 10001 beacon
COPY --from=build /beacon-server /usr/local/bin/beacon-server
USER beacon
EXPOSE 8500 8600 8502
HEALTHCHECK --interval=10s --timeout=3s --retries=3 --start-period=10s CMD wget -q --spider http://localhost:8500/health || exit 1
ENTRYPOINT ["/sbin/tini", "--", "beacon-server"]
